  "notes": "{定義|ていぎ} means definition - a precise statement of meaning. Used in academic, legal, and technical contexts.\n\nGRAMMAR:\nUsed as a noun or する verb ({定義|ていぎ}する = to define).\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {定義|ていぎ}する: to define\n- {定義|ていぎ}づける: to define, establish a definition\n- {広義|こうぎ}の{定義|ていぎ}: broad definition\n- {狭義|きょうぎ}の{定義|ていぎ}: narrow definition\n- {定義|ていぎ}に{従|したが}う: according to the definition\n\nPATTERNS:\n- 〜を{定義|ていぎ}する: to define ~\n- 〜の{定義|ていぎ}: the definition of ~\n- {定義|ていぎ}が{曖昧|あいまい}: the definition is vague\n\nRELATED:\n- {意味|いみ}: meaning\n- {説明|せつめい}: explanation",
